	(text "okay, SO,\nLooking at TI's datasheet,\nThe block diagram plus the application circuit shows this being 1uF,\nBUT in the recommended operating conditions chart it's 0.1uF.\n\nCapacitor prices are through the roof right now for some dumb\nfucking reason,\nso i'm not buying new caps if i dont have to.\nI'm gonna use a 3.3uF for this and vdd since it's cheaper lol"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
