	(text "UPDATE: I'm using a pouch cell now!\nIt has a built-in protection circuit,\nso a BMS is omitted here.\n\nMake sure you're also buying pouch cells\nwith a builtin protection circuit!\n\nI'm using HTP4056 here w/ 1.2A max. Another option would be\nTP5000X which would allow much higher charging current,\nbut brings too much complexity (switching instead of ldo)\nthat it's not really worth it imo."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
